WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.352
Allah chose Salih as a prophet. He told his people, Worship only the One Allah!

2
00:00:05.752 --> 00:00:12.112
The people of Thamud carved beautiful stone houses into the mountains. They lived in plenty, but grew more and more proud.

3
00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:18.392
They did not believe him. They said, If you are a prophet, make this giant rock bring forth a she-camel!

4
00:00:18.792 --> 00:00:25.080
Allah granted it! In the holy light, the rock split open, and a beautiful she-camel walked out.

5
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:30.160
This is Allah's she-camel. Do not harm her. On her day of drinking, let her drink.

6
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:35.888
But the wicked people broke their promise and harmed the camel. Salih was heartbroken.

7
00:00:36.288 --> 00:00:42.456
After a mighty blast, the city was destroyed. Remember: always keep your promises.
